      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A Terrain is a GameObject with a Terrain and a Terrain Collider. Its shape, layers and plants live in a Terrain Data asset. Terrain Width, Length and Height set its size in metres; Heightmap Resolution sets how many points carry the shape: more points, finer detail.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Heightmap Resolution goes from 129 to 33. What happens to the hill?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Terrain 1 \u203A Terrain Settings.\n2. Set Heightmap Resolution to 33 and look at the hill.\n3. Undo (Ctrl+Z).\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Unity Manual \u203A Terrain \u203A Terrain settings</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6055507529455485361, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
