  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A Terrain Layer is the terrain's version of a material: a Diffuse texture, a Normal Map, a Mask Map, and a Tile Size in metres. A terrain lists its layers in Paint Texture; the first layer covers everything until another is painted over it.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> The grass layer's Tile Size goes from 2 m to 10 m. What changes on the ground?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Terrain 4 \u203A Paint Terrain \u203A Paint Texture.\n2. Select the grass layer; set its Tile Size to 10 by 10.\n3. Look through the station camera, then set it back to 2.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 3 \xB7 Textures \u203A Texture-Placement (repetition at scale)</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
